  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Controlling diseases in sweet potato and enset in South Sudan and Ethiop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen capacity in education and research on plant protection to improve productivity in sweet potato and enset and resilience of small farmers to climatic changes in Ethiopia and South Sudan by building capacity at Hawassa and Mekelle Universities in Ethiopia and at the University of Juba in South Sudan, in partnership with the Norwegian University of Life Sciences.</narrative>
  </description>
